# IB15's primary file: same "before" shape as fabric-change-before.net, PLUS a switch (S3) that
# already exists in the topology but starts with NO port connections at all -- i.e. present and
# powered on, but not cabled in yet. ibsim's discovery (and OpenSM) will not see S3 until you connect
# it live with the console's `Link` command -- this is what makes IB15's "hot" topology change
# possible without restarting ibsim.
#
# Before any Link commands: identical, from a discovery point of view, to fabric-change-before.net.
#   Hca1
#    |
#    S1
#    |
#    S2
#    |
#   Hca2
#
#   S3 exists but is invisible (no links) until you run, in the ibsim console:
#     Link "S3"[1] "Hca1"[2]
#     Link "S3"[2] "S2"[3]
#
# After those two commands, the fabric matches fabric-change-after.net's shape:
#   Hca1
#    | \
#    |  \
#    S1  S3
#    |  /
#    | /
#    S2
#    |
#   Hca2

Switch	4 "S1"
[1]	"Hca1"[1]
[2]	"S2"[2]

Switch	4 "S3"

Switch	4 "S2"
[1]	"Hca2"[1]
[2]	"S1"[2]

Hca	2 "Hca1"
[1]	"S1"[1]

Hca	2 "Hca2"
[1]	"S2"[1]
